Stage 1: Initialization and Diagnostic Planning
1: Main Agent analyzes task T and generates an initial
optimization roadmap R;

2: Vision Agent trains the baseline; Critic mechanism iden-
tifies weak-class bottlenecks;
Stage 2: Iterative Policy Optimization
3: Main Agent selects a data-level direction from Sdata (here
instantiated as augmentation: rotation, flip, mixup); re-
tained if recall improves;

4: Main Agent selects a few-shot direction for weak classes
from the current search space;
5: if overall accuracy decreases then
6:
Critic mechanism rejects the direction and records the
failure in E to avoid repetition;

